Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.53,0:00:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样  我们一起去杀些凶鬼恶灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you say we kill some evil sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.37,0:00:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惹点麻烦吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we raise a little hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.91,0:00:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆  小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam. Look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:16.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要拿自己的灵魂换吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're offering up your own soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.67,0:00:18.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只需要复活萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you gotta do is bring Sam back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你一年  就一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give you one year and one year only.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.59,0:00:23.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能让他死  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't let him die, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:24.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.64,0:00:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真想掐死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could throttle you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.76,0:00:28.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管我需要做什么  我一定要帮你脱困\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what it takes. I'm gonna get you out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.85,0:00:30.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们困住一个十字路口恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We trapped a Crossroads demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.35,0:00:32.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想办法钻交易的空子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to welch our way out of the deal in any way,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.31,0:00:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么样的刀能杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of blade can kill a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:41.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天的话  我会说没有这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, I'd have said there was no such thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.49,0:00:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那无名小妞是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that masked chick?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.41,0:00:45.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:47.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是刚救了你的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the girl that just saved your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:13.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.61,0:01:19.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你送她回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for driving her back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我又没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not like I had a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:23.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她大发脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}She pitched a fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.99,0:01:27.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:30.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.49,0:01:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.86,0:01:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但今晚你该去爸爸家住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but tonight's Dad's night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.16,0:01:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.96,0:01:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢去爸爸家住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like Dad's night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.17,0:01:38.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再不想去爸爸家住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want Dad to have a night anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.29,0:01:39.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么突然这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.17,0:01:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以前明明喜欢去爸爸家住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to love going to your dad's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.38,0:01:43.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, he loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.34,0:01:44.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且也很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he misses you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.47,0:01:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我讨厌那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I hate it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.05,0:01:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不讨厌那里  - 我就是讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't hate it. - Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.72,0:01:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好凶  那里还有怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's mean. And there are monsters there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.35,0:01:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再不想去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.77,0:01:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你别让怪物抓到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't let the monsters get me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.31,0:01:59.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.26,0:03:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么叫你不觉得会成功  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean you don't think it'll work, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.93,0:03:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是恶魔驱逐仪式吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a demon-dispelling ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.31,0:04:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许我们翻译错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe we got the translation wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.65,0:04:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能就任由迪恩在地狱里煎熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can't let Dean fry in hell while we...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定有什么能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's gotta be something that will...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:09.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得挂了  不说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.24,0:04:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:12.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是在叫披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just ordering pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.78,0:04:15.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥们  你知道你就在餐馆里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you do realize that you're in a restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.53,0:04:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, oh, yeah. I
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.74,0:04:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是好想吃披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}just felt like pizza, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:23.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  古怪小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Weirdy McWeirderton.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.09,0:04:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可能有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think I got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.21,0:04:29.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,印第安纳州西塞罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cicero, Indiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个男人跌在了自己的电锯上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falls on his own power saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.35,0:04:37.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.89,0:04:38.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么  就这吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.89,0:04:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个电锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}One power saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.06,0:04:42.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.23,0:04:47.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得这是案子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think that this is a case?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.65,0:04:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know. Could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Dean, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  西塞罗还有比\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. There's something better in...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.40,0:04:54.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,案子更好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better in Cicero than just a case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.87,0:04:55.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.78,0:04:56.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉莎·布雷登\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa Braeden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.79,0:04:59.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我该问吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should I even ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.54,0:05:01.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得我去公路旅行过一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that road trip I took...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.75,0:05:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概八年前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}about eight years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.75,0:05:04.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当时和爸爸在奥兰多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you were in Orlando with Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.04,0:05:06.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 了结那个死亡女妖的案子  - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- wrapping up that Banshee thing. - Yeah, yeah. The...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.71,0:05:08.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 五天五州  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Five States, five days. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是啊  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.21,0:05:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.17,0:05:12.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我大部分时间其实是在莉莎·布雷登家度过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although, I spent most of my time in Lisa Braeden's loft.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:14.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:15.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要一路开去西塞罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna drive all the way to Cicero
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:17.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟个小妞鬼混\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to hook up with some random chick?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:19.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是个瑜伽老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a yoga teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:21.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我这辈子最柔软的周末\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the bendiest weekend of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.89,0:05:23.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  行行好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, have a heart, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:25.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的临终遗愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my dying wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.02,0:05:26.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还有多少临终遗愿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, how many dying wishes are you gonna get?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.94,0:05:28.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能有多少是多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}As many as I can squeeze out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.65,0:05:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.53,0:05:32.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑一个  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smile, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.99,0:05:36.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.99,0:05:36.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天知道我跟冈比度过24小时后肯定笑得合不拢嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows I'm gonna be smiling after 24 hours with Gumby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.78,0:05:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冈比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gumby girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.58,0:05:41.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我是她身边的红马波奇吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that make me Pokey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用等我了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wait up for me, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.01,0:05:54.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:38.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:40.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:42.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:45.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多久没见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how long's it been?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八年了  要九年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight, going on nine years now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.10,0:06:49.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真疯狂  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:50.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:53.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么来这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正好经过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just... I was passing through, and I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.11,0:06:58.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在没忍住\N{\fnArial\fs30}couldn't resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.70,0:07:01.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我记得你喜欢惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remembered that you love surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.24,0:07:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.33,0:07:06.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.33,0:07:10.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.38,0:07:14.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉  你来得不太巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. You kind of came at a bad time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在办派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're having a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.09,0:07:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Party?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.13,0:07:19.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I love parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.69,0:07:31.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是谁的派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who's the party for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.48,0:07:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本  我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben. My son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.32,0:07:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你有...  - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have a...? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.57,0:07:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.78,0:07:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了  AC/DC最酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! AC/DC rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.45,0:07:42.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:44.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 太酷了  - 他多大...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That is so cool. - How old...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:45.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.16,0:07:50.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩  可以失陪一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, could you excuse me a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.87,0:07:52.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  当然  别担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure, don't mind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.23,0:08:12.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到莉莎喊他迪恩了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear Lisa call him Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.02,0:08:13.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.27,0:08:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道迪恩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know about Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.48,0:08:18.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个迪恩  我这辈子最美妙的一夜的迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dean? Best-Night-of-My-Life Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:21.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道  跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.20,0:08:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们共度了疯狂  几乎不合法的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they had this crazy, semi-illegal...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:45.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.85,0:08:47.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.90,0:09:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是你生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's your birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.16,0:09:04.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派对挺不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cool party.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.24,0:09:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥们  这简直太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, it's so freaking sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.41,0:09:09.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有这个蹦床  简直牛叉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this Moonbounce? It's epic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.37,0:09:12.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  是很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's pretty awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:13.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道还有谁觉得它很棒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who else thinks they're awesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.13,0:09:17.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那简直像座辣妹之城\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like hot-chick city out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.84,0:09:26.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心  女士们  麻烦来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out, ladies, here comes trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.73,0:09:39.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:41.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.03,0:09:42.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.24,0:09:45.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:49.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.41,0:09:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.25,0:09:54.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:09:59.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.42,0:10:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我担心凯蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm worried about Katie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.17,0:10:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得她可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there might be something...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.30,0:10:08.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}wrong with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.93,0:10:10.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.47,0:10:12.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小可怜刚失去了爸爸  她肯定难过死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor girl just lost her dad, she's devastated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.68,0:10:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我不是那意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's not what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.73,0:10:20.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她真的有很大的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is something really wrong with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.28,0:10:27.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不确定凯蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure that Katie is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:29.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是凯蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.37,0:10:31.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不确定那是我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure that's my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.54,0:10:39.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你很悲痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're grieving.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.09,0:10:42.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你不能说这种话  凯蒂需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't talk like that. Katie needs you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:43.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不  你不懂  - 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. You don't understand... - Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会找人帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.59,0:10:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.43,0:10:53.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.35,0:10:55.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.52,0:11:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我见过本了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I met Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.07,0:11:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这孩子不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.41,0:11:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.37,0:11:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.91,0:11:13.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不禁注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I couldn't help but notice that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.95,0:11:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他要八岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's turning 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.83,0:11:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你和我  那个...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me. You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.67,0:11:28.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是想问他是不是你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not trying to ask me if he's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.26,0:11:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  当然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.76,0:11:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:34.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.77,0:11:36.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.27,0:11:37.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.40,0:11:43.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.03,0:11:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯蒂  亲爱的  我们得走了  好吗  来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katie, sweetheart, we gotta go, okay? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.57,0:11:51.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧  凯蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Katie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.45,0:11:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你朋友出什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wrong with your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.79,0:11:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她经历了很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been through a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:12:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她前夫刚因一起可怕的事故而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her ex just died in this horrible accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.46,0:12:01.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我读到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Didn't I just read about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.75,0:12:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 电锯吧  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The power saw? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:06.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,近来这一带真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess there's been a lot of bad luck
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.05,0:12:07.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厄运连连\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the neighborhood lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:09.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of bad luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.86,0:12:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.99,0:12:38.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从林肯之后就一直在跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been following me since Lincoln.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.83,0:12:41.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还真是洞若观火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much gets by you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个太好吃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.34,0:12:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直像油炸可卡因  尝尝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like deep-fried crack. Try some.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.01,0:12:54.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的那把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That knife you had...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.39,0:12:56.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能拿它杀恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can kill demons with that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.97,0:12:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要从天而降拯救落难少女时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure comes in handy when I have to swoop in
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.56,0:13:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确非常方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}and save the damsel in distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.06,0:13:03.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你从哪弄来的  - 超市\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd you get it? - SkyMall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.36,0:13:08.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么跟踪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.15,0:13:10.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我对你有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm interested in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.07,0:13:13.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.70,0:13:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.95,0:13:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我喜欢高个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love a tall man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:22.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有反基督什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's the whole antichrist thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.58,0:13:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么  - 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.00,0:13:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一代灵力者孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}generation of psychic kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.33,0:13:26.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黄眼恶魔把你们集结起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yellow-Eyed Demon rounds you up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.79,0:13:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后是《名人大乱斗》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Celebrity Deathmatch ensues...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.46,0:13:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是唯一幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're the sole survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.97,0:13:34.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个好猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a good hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.55,0:13:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黄眼恶魔曾经对你有大计划啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Yellow Eyes had some prettty big plans for you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.39,0:13:40.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾经是关键词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had being the key word.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.64,0:13:42.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对对  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.27,0:13:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叮咚  恶魔死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ding-dong, the demon's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.19,0:13:48.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你仍然很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't change the fact that you're special.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.61,0:13:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像《死亡地带》里的安东尼·迈克尔·豪尔一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}In that Anthony-Michael-Hall,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.11,0:13:51.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有超感幻象的能力  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ESP-vision kind of way. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  那已经停止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that stuff's not happening anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.74,0:13:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自黄眼恶魔死后就停止了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not since Yellow Eyes died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.11,0:13:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你还是个重要人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking you're still a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.74,0:13:59.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考虑到你妈妈的那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, after all that business with your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.91,0:14:03.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是她朋友们的遭遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, what happened to her friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.26,0:14:16.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要好好了解些情况了  朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a little bit of catching up to do, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去查查你妈妈的朋友们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you look into your mom's pals...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then give me a call
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.81,0:14:26.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们到时再聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we'll talk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.61,0:14:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了  你知道镇上有件案子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the way, you do know there's a job in this town, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.33,0:14:42.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 喂  - 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.00,0:14:44.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里真有案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a job here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.87,0:14:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.62,0:14:47.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  记得我们在报上看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You know that one freak accident
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:48.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那一起意外事故吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we read about in the paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来还有四起  根本都没登报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out there's four more that never even made the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.59,0:14:54.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都发生在这间晨山封闭小区里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All in this Morning Hill gated community.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.13,0:14:55.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人从梯子上摔下\N{\fnArial\fs30}People falling off ladders,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:57.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有淹死在热浴盆里的  小区里到处死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}drown in Jacuzzis all over the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.72,0:14:58.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.64,0:14:59.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  绝对有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.72,0:15:02.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漂亮的小区大门也挡不住的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something these nice big gates can't protect them from.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.45,0:15:22.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯蒂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.25,0:15:25.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.41,0:15:26.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我玩吧  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play with me, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.21,0:15:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊  好  我们玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sure. Yeah, let's... let's play.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.42,0:15:33.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.09,0:15:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.84,0:15:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也爱你  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.65,0:15:54.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我饿了  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.49,0:16:00.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.62,0:16:02.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:10.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再次为打扰您表示道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}So once again, I'm very sorry to disturb you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.67,0:16:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只想尽快兑现人寿保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just wanna really expedite that life-insurance policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.96,0:16:14.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 当然  - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.92,0:16:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是他摔下来的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where he fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.30,0:16:20.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.34,0:16:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他究竟是怎么...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how exactly did he...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:25.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就在屋里  换灯泡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was just inside, changing a light bulb.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:26.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是没站稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've lost his balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.22,0:16:28.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 事发时你在场吗  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Were you here when this happened? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.48,0:16:29.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我们女儿达科塔在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only one here was our daughter, Dakota.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.94,0:16:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.88,0:16:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  我想我该问的都问了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, I think that's all I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:16:58.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 好  - 那我不打扰你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - I'll get out of your way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.92,0:16:59.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.12,0:17:29.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:32.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你吃吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.12,0:17:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy will be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:49.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给妈妈点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just... Just give Mommy a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.27,0:17:55.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.19,0:17:57.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.45,0:18:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.24,0:18:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:08.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.03,0:18:09.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 给妈妈点时间  - 让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just give Mommy a minute. - Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.70,0:18:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.58,0:18:11.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:12.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.29,0:18:15.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:17.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.04,0:18:18.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给妈妈点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give Mommy a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.31,0:18:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真是太可爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you just the cutest thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:44.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯蒂  可以把这个放进厨房吗  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Katie, could you put these in the kitchen, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.20,0:18:51.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 凯蒂似乎还好  毕竟...  - 她没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Katie seems okay considering... - She's fine. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.83,0:18:53.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听着  - 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look... - And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗  说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you doing, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.91,0:18:55.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:18:58.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都好  现在真的不方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we're fine. And this isn't a good time...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.21,0:19:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是不知道你是打算留着房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wasn't sure if you're planning on keeping the house...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是出售  我们西塞罗地产\N{\fnArial\fs30}or selling. We at Cicero Realty...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.59,0:19:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了  现在不方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I told you it's not a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:12.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要吃冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.60,0:19:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈  冰淇淋  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy. Ice cream, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.27,0:19:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.24,0:19:31.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:36.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捉迷藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide-and-seek, hide-and-seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.81,0:19:38.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.54,0:19:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去过我的派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were at my party.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.92,0:19:42.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.02,0:19:55.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗  出什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay? Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:05.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们玩的是你的游戏机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That your game they're playing with?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.74,0:20:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞恩·翰弗莱借走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ryan Humphrey borrowed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.36,0:20:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在他不肯还了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he won't give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.07,0:20:10.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要我去...  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you want me to go...? - Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.24,0:20:11.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.28,0:20:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有小贱人才找大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only bitches send a grownup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.83,0:20:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没说错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.75,0:20:18.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不是小贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am not a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.38,0:20:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是翰弗莱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that Humphrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.92,0:20:26.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要少吃点汉堡的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one who needs to lay off the burgers?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.14,0:20:32.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中了  真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it. Go excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:34.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.26,0:20:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.69,0:20:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瑞恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.87,0:20:55.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要回我的游戏机  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like my game back, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.62,0:20:57.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊  来拿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.84,0:21:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看  就跟你们说他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Told you guys he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.85,0:21:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.23,0:21:22.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥们  那太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude. That was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.85,0:21:25.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 击掌  好样的  - 本杰明·艾萨克·布雷登\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Up high. Nice work. - Benjamin Isaac Braeden.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.82,0:21:26.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.90,0:21:27.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他偷了我的游戏机\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stole my game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.98,0:21:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就踢他吗  你什么时候...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you kick him? Since when is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.99,0:21:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你叫我儿子打那小子的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell my son to beat up that kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.45,0:21:36.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.62,0:21:37.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总得有人教他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, somebody had to teach him
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.41,0:21:38.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,踢霸凌者的蛋蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to kick a bully in the nads.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.74,0:21:40.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁叫你教他任何东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who asked you to teach him anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.45,0:21:41.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别紧张  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just relax, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.71,0:21:44.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you even still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.17,0:21:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们好久之前一起度过了一个周末罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had one weekend together a million years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.59,0:21:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.55,0:21:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也无权干涉我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no business with my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.55,0:21:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 莉莎  - 离我们远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lisa. - Just leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.22,0:21:56.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.27,0:22:02.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.71,0:22:29.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这世上最爱你了  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you most in the whole wide world, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.13,0:22:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.71,0:22:32.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, hold still.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.60,0:22:47.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong, Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.90,0:22:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.73,0:22:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.44,0:22:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们现在去吃冰淇淋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we going for ice cream now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.95,0:22:56.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.24,0:22:58.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去吃冰淇淋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going for ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.32,0:24:56.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.74,0:25:03.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在能吃冰淇淋了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have that ice cream now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.22,0:25:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这镇上的孩子有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong with the kids in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.18,0:25:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  可不是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.43,0:25:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对魔童有什么了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you know about changelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.52,0:25:31.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邪恶的怪物婴儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evil monster babies?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.81,0:25:33.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  未必是婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not necessarily babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.15,0:25:34.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.77,0:25:38.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瘆人的  拿你当午餐盯的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creepy, stare-at-you-like-you're-lunch kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.03,0:25:38.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.15,0:25:42.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个受害人家里都有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one at every victim's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.03,0:25:48.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔童能完美地模仿儿童\N{\fnArial\fs30}So changelings can perfectly mimic children.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.66,0:25:51.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据传说  他们会从窗户爬进去  抓走孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to lore, they climb in the window, snatch the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.46,0:25:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个孩子家的窗台上有污迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there were marks on the windowsill at one of the kids house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.33,0:25:55.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看着像血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looked to me like blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.29,0:25:57.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔童抓走孩子  变成其模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So changeling grabs the kid, assumes its form...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.92,0:26:00.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入幸福家庭  只为寻乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joins the happy fam. Just for kicks?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.84,0:26:01.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.22,0:26:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔童以母亲为食\N{\fnArial\fs30}Changelings feed on the mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.30,0:26:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吸食滑液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Synovial fluid.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.01,0:26:09.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈们的后颈会有奇怪的瘀痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moms have these odd bruises on the back of their necks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.90,0:26:16.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔童能吸食她们几周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Changelings can drain them for a few weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.73,0:26:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈们才会死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}before Mom finally croaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.65,0:26:20.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后还有爸爸  保姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there's Dad, the babysitter...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.90,0:26:22.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  所有妨碍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Seems like anyone who gets between
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.78,0:26:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔童进食的人都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}a changeling and its food sourse ends up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.49,0:26:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火是唯一能杀他们的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fire's the only way to waste them?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.78,0:26:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对  - 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yep. - Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.03,0:26:29.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只需要冲进去  把孩子拖出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we'll just bust in, drag the kids out,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.12,0:26:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在门前草坪上烧死他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}torch them on the front lawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.87,0:26:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邻居们肯定高兴呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll play great with the neighbors.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.29,0:26:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真孩子呢  他们会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the real ones? What happens to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.66,0:26:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据传说  他们会被藏在地下某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to lore, they stash them underground somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.46,0:26:38.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么  但如果是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't know why, but if it's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.67,0:26:40.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真孩子可能还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}real kids might be out there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.09,0:26:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那得开始找了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better start looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.13,0:26:42.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.05,0:26:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一带的孩子都可能受害吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}any kid in the neighborhood's vulnerable?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.72,0:26:46.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.80,0:26:47.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得先去个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta make a stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.60,0:26:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想去看个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna check on someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.51,0:26:49.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩  如果真孩子还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, if the real kids are still alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.97,0:26:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们没时间...  - 我们必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- we don't have time to... - We have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.19,0:26:58.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 迪恩  你怎么...  - 我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, what are you...? - I was thinking...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.15,0:27:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本的生日  我都没拿礼物来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben's birthday, I didn't even bring him a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.48,0:27:02.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.19,0:27:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不  我觉得过意不去  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No, I feel terrible. So
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.53,0:27:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.24,0:27:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休个长周末吧  就你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a long weekend. Just the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.99,0:27:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我请  - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On me. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.79,0:27:12.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的  我还听说六旗游乐园现在特棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. In fact, I hear Six Flags is great this time of year.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.91,0:27:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在去吧  不会堵车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go now, avoid the traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.62,0:27:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,齐格弗里德·胡迪尼  这是谁的卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Siegfried Houdini. Whose card is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.13,0:27:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.84,0:27:23.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管了  能用的  我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind. It'll work, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.80,0:27:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.01,0:27:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.84,0:27:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.64,0:27:30.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  本  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing, Ben, it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.85,0:27:32.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他走  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make him go away, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.60,0:27:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.61,0:27:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.57,0:27:42.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.07,0:27:45.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这恐怕不是个好主意  - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think it's a good idea. - Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.41,0:28:37.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们抓了本  他变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took Ben. He's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.08,0:28:38.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么  你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.37,0:28:40.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  我确定  我看过他的窗台了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm sure. I checked his windowsill.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.63,0:28:41.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.50,0:28:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得不是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think it is blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.00,0:28:44.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且我可能知道孩子们在哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think I know where the kids are.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.35,0:29:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,红土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.11,0:29:03.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,窗台上是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what was on the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.65,0:29:05.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  你走前门  我绕到后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You take the front. I'll go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.61,0:30:30.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本  本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben? Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.11,0:30:32.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的  我会救你出去  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. I'm gonna get you out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.41,0:30:37.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.80,0:30:57.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是私产  我要报警了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is private property. I'm calling the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.15,0:31:10.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你听到了  出去  - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You heard me. Get out! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.57,0:31:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我拿包的  我这就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me get my bag. I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.90,0:31:13.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没想惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to cause any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.28,0:31:20.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.37,0:31:23.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 本  - 跟我玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ben. - Play with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.79,0:31:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不好玩了  我都哄你上床三次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't funny anymore. I put you to bed three times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.87,0:31:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不想上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't wanna go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.96,0:31:32.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真可爱  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's sweet, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.47,0:31:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.97,0:31:43.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.98,0:31:44.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.98,0:31:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小披萨行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mini pizzas okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.89,0:31:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只有什锦的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deluxe is all we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.27,0:31:48.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.11,0:31:51.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思  还以为你这个月不吃橄榄呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny. I thought we were anti-olives this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.83,0:32:03.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.83,0:32:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会逃出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get out of here, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.75,0:32:10.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.88,0:32:13.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  姑娘们  来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, girls. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.05,0:32:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.01,0:32:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it, that's it, keep moving, keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.93,0:32:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  大家退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Everybody back. Everybody back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.26,0:32:21.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遮上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.27,0:32:26.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.52,0:32:28.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.73,0:32:31.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.94,0:32:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  本  来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Ben, come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.19,0:32:33.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他先来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.94,0:32:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪恩  还有个妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! Dean, there's a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.32,0:32:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 妈妈魔童吗  - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mother changeling? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.32,0:32:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得快把孩子救出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get these kids out. Quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.86,0:32:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里  还有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there. Right there. There's one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.70,0:32:41.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把锁打掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta break the lock.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.87,0:32:44.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这大概就是魔童没杀孩子们的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's why changeling's keeping the kids alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.99,0:32:46.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好让魔童妈妈吃他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}so the Mom can snack on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.04,0:32:50.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来  我扶你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.25,0:32:55.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong, Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.13,0:32:56.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.92,0:32:57.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.92,0:32:58.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.84,0:32:59.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.64,0:33:01.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.98,0:33:17.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不希望你离开我  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't want you to leave me, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.61,0:33:22.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.16,0:33:23.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.04,0:33:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.08,0:33:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么  让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.88,0:33:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in, let me in, let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.40,0:34:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本  快带他们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, get them out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.49,0:34:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.42,0:34:59.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.30,0:35:00.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.71,0:35:02.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.88,0:35:04.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事  妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.13,0:35:06.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.27,0:35:12.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.98,0:35:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想的话  我可以解释一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll explain everything if you want me to...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.60,0:35:16.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但相信我  你可能不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but trust me, you probably don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.23,0:35:18.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的是本安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Important thing is that Ben's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.07,0:35:21.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.36,0:35:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.16,0:35:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们慢慢来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna give you guys some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.66,0:35:33.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.34,0:35:43.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔童\N{\fnArial\fs30}Changelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.72,0:35:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是从未提过我是做什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how I never mentioned my job?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.97,0:35:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是做这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.60,0:35:51.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还真是不想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I so didn't wanna know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.64,0:35:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得他会没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.06,0:35:56.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  他会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I think he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.35,0:35:59.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.52,0:36:02.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你百分百确定他不是我的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're 100 percent sure that he is not mine? Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.36,0:36:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你无关啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're off the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.61,0:36:05.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还小时我做过一次血检\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did a blood test when he was a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.20,0:36:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was this guy. Some
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.91,0:36:09.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个机车党酒吧的吧台助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}barback in a biker joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.66,0:36:11.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.74,0:36:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有喜欢的型\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a type.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.20,0:36:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮夹克  几道疤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leather jacket, couple of scars,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.46,0:36:17.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有转寄地址  我都记得呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}no mailing address, I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.21,0:36:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时是挺野的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I was a little wild back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.50,0:36:22.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我当上妈妈之前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I became a mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.34,0:36:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.22,0:36:25.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你放松吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.09,0:36:28.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.10,0:36:37.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.69,0:36:40.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么觉得你似乎很失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear you look disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.69,0:36:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.82,0:36:49.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很奇怪  你的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's weird, you know. Your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.66,0:36:51.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这房子  这孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, this house, the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.33,0:36:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是我的生活  永远不会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my life, never will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.91,0:36:58.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我近来出了点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some stuff happened to me recently and...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.38,0:37:04.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正  我这种情况的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, a guy in my situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.46,0:37:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会开始想\N{\fnArial\fs30}you start to think, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.76,0:37:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有天总会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna be gone one day...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.34,0:37:09.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了一辆车  我还能留下什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what am I leaving behind besides a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.64,0:37:12.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.35,0:37:15.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本或许不是你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben may not be your kid but...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.47,0:37:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果不是你  他就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}he wouldn't be alive if it wasn't for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.06,0:37:21.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我说  这很重大\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lot, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.32,0:37:31.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要说一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just for the record...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.62,0:37:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的孩子很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got a great kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.75,0:37:38.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我是他爸我会很骄傲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have been proud to be his dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.55,0:37:51.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look if...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.72,0:37:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你想多留一阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you wanna stick around for a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.14,0:37:57.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're welcome to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.65,0:38:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.27,0:38:06.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有很多工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a lot of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.94,0:38:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也不是我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.13,0:38:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想核实些信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to check some facts...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.84,0:38:30.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你的秘书核实一起火灾\N{\fnArial\fs30}with your... with your secretary about a fire
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.88,0:38:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生在2006年11月24日\N{\fnArial\fs30}that occurred on November 24th, 2006...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.64,0:38:35.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,位于堪萨斯州劳伦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Lawrence, Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.72,0:38:38.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫哈戴克  好  好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hardecker was his name. Okay. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.60,0:38:40.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想查他的死亡日期\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just trying to find out the date he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.52,0:38:42.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是菲尔·琼斯警察局长\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Police Chief Phil Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.94,0:38:43.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,7月13日\N{\fnArial\fs30}July 13th.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.73,0:38:44.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以为我查一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you check the records for me
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.56,0:38:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗伯特·坎贝尔吗  2001年7月19日\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a Robert Campbell, July 19th, 2001.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.98,0:38:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当场死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead on arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.36,0:38:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想知道死因\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm after is, is cause of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.70,0:38:53.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心脏病吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heart condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.41,0:38:55.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是心脏外科手术医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't he a cardiac surgeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.53,0:38:56.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道他不会发现自己有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't he have known about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.99,0:39:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想查下华莱士太太的死亡信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm looking for information on Mrs. Wallace's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.70,0:39:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两起死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.21,0:39:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一个是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was the other?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.46,0:39:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爱德·坎贝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed Campbell?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.63,0:39:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人生还吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.38,0:39:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我就需要这些  非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's all I needed, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.05,0:39:15.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.97,0:39:20.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.43,0:39:23.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.85,0:39:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈所有的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of my mom's friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.48,0:39:28.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生  叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}her doctor, her uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.48,0:39:29.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一个认识她的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone who ever knew her
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.52,0:39:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都被系统性地一个个地干掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}systematically wiped off the map one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.36,0:39:34.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人费尽力气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone went through a hell of a lot of trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.90,0:39:36.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想掩盖行踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to cover their tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.70,0:39:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.08,0:39:40.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黄眼恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yellow-Eyed Demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.12,0:39:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.20,0:39:44.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对我如影随形  对我了若指掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}You show up wherever I am, you know all about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.66,0:39:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我妈了若指掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know all about my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.92,0:39:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already told you, I'm just...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.71,0:39:50.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对哦  你只是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Right. Yeah, yeah. Just... Just a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.21,0:39:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是个猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.21,0:39:53.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偏巧对我的家庭比我还了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}who happens to know more about my own family than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.13,0:39:57.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell me who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.05,0:39:59.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, it...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.01,0:39:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.14,0:40:01.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.97,0:40:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那不重要  - 告诉我你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It doesn't matter. - Just tell me who you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.90,0:40:11.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.20,0:40:18.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别急着动用圣水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think twice before going for that holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.11,0:40:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我个不用的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me one reason I shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.49,0:40:20.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来帮你的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to help you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.53,0:40:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that some kind of joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.08,0:40:23.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝可鉴\N{\fnArial\fs30}God's honest truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.91,0:40:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.16,0:40:25.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.96,0:40:27.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别那么种族歧视\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be such a racist.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.92,0:40:30.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来找你是因为我想帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here because I wanna help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.88,0:40:33.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你信任我  我就能帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can if you trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.01,0:40:34.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.51,0:40:36.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,萨姆  冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.93,0:40:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说  那些凶案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start talking. All those murders,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.18,0:40:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔想掩盖什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what was the demon trying to cover up?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.01,0:40:41.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.68,0:40:42.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to my mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.64,0:40:44.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I honestly don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.43,0:40:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也在查那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm trying to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.19,0:40:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只知道这都是为了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that it's about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.19,0:40:50.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.02,0:40:53.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还不懂吗  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get it, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.32,0:40:54.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是为了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.07,0:40:56.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈妈的事  她朋友们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to your mom, what happened to her friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.86,0:40:59.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们想掩盖他对你做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're trying to cover up what he did to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.82,0:41:01.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想帮你查清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wanna help you figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.57,0:41:02.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么想帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you wanna help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.99,0:41:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自有原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.91,0:41:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶魔不都是一样的  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all demons are the same, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.79,0:41:09.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的目标也不都一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of us want the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.75,0:41:10.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.29,0:41:13.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想时不时帮帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna help you from time to time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.25,0:41:14.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.13,0:41:19.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你让我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you let me...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.43,0:41:22.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有好处给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's something in it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.93,0:41:24.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能给我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could you possibly...?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.35,0:41:26.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能帮你救你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could help you save your brother.

